#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Production perception core for the WRO Future Engineers robot.

This module contains sensor-independent state management, LiDAR pose
estimation, OTOS drift correction, obstacle detection, and camera color
classification. It intentionally contains no web server, ROS node, OTOS I/O,
or drive/motor control code.
"""

